            </div> <div class="head-line clearfix"><h1><span class="title">亿航eVTOL飞越洱海展示出行物流双场景 将推动大理低空场景常态化飞行</span> <span class="btn-audio"></span></h1> <audio id="audioDom" loop="loop" src="" class="hide"></audio> <div class="pageShare"><div class="setFont">字体：
                        <span id="fontSmall">小</span> <span id="fontNormal" class="active">中</span> <span id="fontBig">大</span></div> <div class="share">分享到：<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="wx"></a><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="wb"></a><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="xcx"></a><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="khd"></a> <div class="wx-ewm"><img src="zxcode_20260618a178f39fc95e46a8b6d1fc5c2f647a9b.jpg"></div> <div class="xcx-ewm"><img></div> <div class="khd-ewm"><img src="//www.news.cn/2021detail/images/qrcode-app.png"></div></div></div></div></div></div> <div class="adv domMob"><div class="advCont" style="display:none"><ins data-ycad-slot="2305"></ins></div> <div class="advShow"></div></div> <div class="mheader domMobile" data="datasource:20260618a178f39fc95e46a8b6d1fc5c2f647a9b" datatype="content"><h1><span class="title">亿航eVTOL飞越洱海展示出行物流双场景 将推动大理低空场景常态化飞行</span></h1> <div class="info">
            2026-06-18 16:18:19
            <span>
                来源：新华网
            </span></div></div> <div class="main clearfix"><div class="main-left left"><div id="detail" data="datasource:20260618a178f39fc95e46a8b6d1fc5c2f647a9b" datatype="content"><span id="detailContent"><p data-mce-fragment="1">&emsp;&emsp;<span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">6月17日，</span><span data-mce-fragment="1">风起大理，云启低空</span><span data-mce-fragment="1">——亿航智能EH216-S飞越洱海暨低空合作签约仪式</span><span data-mce-fragment="1">在大理喜洲古镇举行。云南省大理州州长陈真永、亿航智能中国区总经理李晓娜等领导嘉宾出席活动，共同见证低空科技在大理本土场景的融合应用。</span></span></p><p data-mce-fragment="1">&emsp;&emsp;<span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">在众人的期待与瞩目下，亿航智能</span><span data-mce-fragment="1">EH216-S无人驾驶载人航空器从喜洲古镇飞往双廊古镇，用时</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1">10</span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">分钟飞越洱海。亿航的物流航空器同步完成配送飞行，展现低空物流场景。出行与物流两大场景联动飞行，让现场嘉宾直观感受到无人驾驶航空器与大理自然人文相融共生的独特魅力。</span></span></p><p data-mce-fragment="1">&emsp;&emsp;<span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">活动现场，</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">亿航智能分别与雄飞智慧航空（大理）有限公司、空际全视线（云南）科技有限公司进行合作签约，各方将整合资源、协同发力，共同推进大理低空经济的高质量发展。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;" data-mce-fragment="1"><img id="g34Nh3YqDh7b7NipPQ98" src="20260618a178f39fc95e46a8b6d1fc5c2f647a9b_20260618ca5be3318c5a4b99a003710db5076a14.png" width="554" height="312" data-mce-fragment="1" data-material-id="26061812638482" data-name="20260618ca5be3318c5a4b99a003710db5076a14.png"></p><p data-mce-fragment="1">&emsp;&emsp;<span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">李晓娜表示：</span><span data-mce-fragment="1">“</span><span data-mce-fragment="1">大理</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">文旅资源丰富，</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">具备发展低空经济的优势资源。</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">亿航智能愿充分发挥经验优势，携手合作伙伴在大理推广无人驾驶航空器，合力打造低空经济示范标杆。</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">”</span></span></p><p data-mce-fragment="1">&emsp;&emsp;<span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">低空经济已成为国家新兴支柱产业。云南省政府于</span><span data-mce-fragment="1">6月11日</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">最新</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">发布的《云南省有序拓展低空经济应用场景实施方案》提出，要探索推广一批安全有保障、商业可持续、群众易接纳的规模化应用场景。</span></span></p><p data-mce-fragment="1">&emsp;&emsp;<span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">此次亿航智能的飞行活动</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">深度契合云南低空经济发展顶层政策</span>, 迅速响应政策，</span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">为云南低空经济场景的创新发展提供了鲜活示范，对推动大理构建立体交通体系、升级文旅消费业态、培育低空经济新产业具有重要意义</span></span><span data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">。接下来，大理将持续探索拓展低空出行、空中游览、低空物流等应用，逐步推动亿航智能</span>eVTOL开展常态化飞行，不断丰富低空应经济场景。</span></p></span> <div id="articleEdit"><span class="tiyi1 domPC"><a href="javascript:void(0);" class="advise">【纠错】</a> <div id="advisebox01" class="tiyi01" style="display:none;"><div><iframe id="jc_link1" border="0" marginwidth="0" framespacing="0" marginheight="0" frameborder="0" noresize="noresize" scrolling="no" vspale="0" style="width:600px;height:350px;float:left;"></iframe></div> <div class="tiyi03"><div id="jc_close1" style="cursor:pointer;"></div></div></div></span> <span class="editor"> 【责任编辑:高瑞东】 </span></div></div> <div class="columBox relatedNews" data="datasource:20260618a178f39fc95e46a8b6d1fc5c2f647a9b" datatype="content"> <div class="col-cont"><ul></ul></div></div> <div class="nextpage clearfix" style="display:none;"><div class="nextpage-tit">阅读下一篇：</div> <div class="nextpage-cont"><a href="#"></a></div></div> <div class="ad_right domPC" style="margin-bottom:20px"><ins data-ycad-slot="399"></ins></div> <div class="domPC"><ins data-ycad-slot="2168"></ins></div> <div class="domPC"><ins data-ycad-slot="2169"></ins></div> <div class="bookList clearfix domPC"><ul></ul></div> <div class="domPC"><ins d